{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short story created by the CnGal  to commemorate its first anniversary in 2016, now brought back for everyone to enjoy again as the tenth anniversary approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes many jokes about the  Chinese visual novels. We hope you enjoy this short story and fall in love with our mascot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is a newcomer game producer. His ambitious project proposal is harshly criticized by his senior, deemed completely worthless. In his personal life, he's received countless &quot;nice guy&quot; rejections while trying to find a girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Life is so hard\u2014this has to be your fault!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, everything changes when he's suddenly woken up by a beautiful girl who claims to be the &quot;CnGal Kanban Girl&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Thank you... for still thinking I'm a nice person.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clicking &quot;Start Game,&quot; progress by clicking the mouse to read the story in this visual novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single-ending story with an approximate playtime of one hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Staff</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director: \u9171\u6cb9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning: \u62fe\u7396\u3001\u9171\u6cb9\u3001\u7075\u7f21\u5fc3\u3001\u9732\u5207\u4e38KyTN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario: \u9171\u6cb9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staging: \u9171\u6cb9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Art: \u8d3a\u5d3dLoad (YAMAYURI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring: Kazuzu (YAMAYURI)\u3001\u5c0f\u5361 (YAMAYURI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds: Subaru\u6634\u3001J-coco\u3001Kazuzu (YAMAYURI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: \u5f20\u7426\u3001\u8ddf\u5f03</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming: \u5f71\u98ce\u79e6\u3001\u7070\u96c0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine: The NVL Maker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI: \u5471\u592a</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks:<br>\u2003\u2003Licensed Music: TOGA\u3001ISAo<br>\u2003\u2003Licensed Backgrounds: \u5b89\u91ce\u8b72\u3001\u304d\u307e\u3050\u308c\u30a2\u30d5\u30bf\u30fc</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remastered Version Staff</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming Support: \u7d2b\u5fa1_\u5e7d\u5e7d</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u521d\u6b21\u89c1\u9762","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/706633e830c2a5fe813fd457eaa86380d1e2dd3c.jpg"},{"name":"\u4f60\u662f\u4e2a\u597d\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/c05737ec3b26435fd633df0efd9a5f7ab78f9ad9.jpg"},{"name":"\u5feb\u8fdb\u7684\u6781\u9650","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/2959580dd06072bcc7f4a898e325d572ae554546.jpg"},{"name":"\u665a\u5b89\uff0c\u770b\u677f\u5a18","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/94270d83c421b39b552ca2c8c628647e9f7666d6.jpg"},{"name":"\u6492\u82b1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/d1679941333197c27b15f566b87607727f80193d.jpg"},{"name":"\u65e9\u4e0a\u597d\uff0c\u770b\u677f\u5a18","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691760/fa